*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0023
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 850
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0023.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> TRANSACTIONS IN LAST 24 HOURS
    05 TXN-COUNT-24H      PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TRAN-AMT           PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> DAYS SINCE ACCOUNT OPENED
    05 ACCT-AGE-DAYS      PIC 9(5).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> RISK LEVEL H/M/L
    05 RISK-GRADE         PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-VELOCITY-SCORE
    DISPLAY "RISK-GRADE=" RISK-GRADE
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
3000-VELOCITY-SCORE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 30 AND TRAN-AMT > 2000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 10
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT - LIMIT 22 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 30
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
